eq 0 \Rightarrow l(\vec{k}) \leq \lceil  rac{k+3}{2} ceil - 1$. Thus, according to lemma ef{zero_tail_lemma}:  egin{equation} F_N^{\vec{k}} = F_{\lceil  rac{k+3}{2} ceil}^{(k_{N-\lceil  rac{k+3}{2} ceil+1},..,{k_N})} \end{equation} 
